# Cypher: openCypher 9 specification and the Neo4j Cypher Manual (5); requirements/languages/cypher.md
name     cypher cql

keyword  MATCH OPTIONAL WHERE RETURN CREATE MERGE DELETE DETACH SET REMOVE WITH UNWIND ORDER BY SKIP
keyword  LIMIT CALL YIELD AS AND OR NOT XOR IN IS DISTINCT CASE WHEN THEN ELSE END UNION ALL EXISTS
keyword  ON ASC DESC STARTS ENDS CONTAINS FOREACH LOAD CSV HEADERS INDEX CONSTRAINT
builtin  true false null count collect size length type id labels keys nodes relationships
builtin  coalesce toUpper toLower toString toInteger range sum avg min max
fold-case

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
string   ` `  : name
sigil    :    : attr
sigil    $    : meta
operators  =<>!+-*/%^|.
calls
